{"candidate_id":"figure-analysis:Figure3:8c7b0e42f89a60f9","artifact_id":"Figure3","visual_type":"other","description":"A four-phase ReCA process visual showing recursive planning, leaf execution, parallel or sequential segment logic, adaptive state refresh, and a detailed single-leaf execution path.","components":[{"name":"Recursive Planning","role":"Hierarchical decomposition of the long-video goal into context-bounded subproblems","visual_evidence":"Top-center panel shows a Root Goal branching through internal and leaf nodes into a variable-length Generated Video Timeline."},{"name":"Root Goal (Long Video)","role":"Initial long-video task supplied to recursive planning","visual_evidence":"A labeled root box sits above the branching planning tree."},{"name":"Internal node (Plan / Allocate)","role":"Non-leaf planning and allocation stage","visual_evidence":"Gray circular nodes are identified in the legend and planning panel as internal nodes."},{"name":"Leaf node (Execute)","role":"Terminal execution unit that invokes generation","visual_evidence":"Blue leaf nodes appear at the bottoms of the planning tree and connect to generated segments."},{"name":"Generated Video Timeline","role":"Variable-length sequence induced by the executed leaves","visual_evidence":"A timeline of blue blocks is shown beneath the recursive tree."},{"name":"Leaf Execution","role":"Generation of one video segment per leaf","visual_evidence":"Phase 2 states that leaf nodes invoke the frozen generator, with multiple segment thumbnails displayed."},{"name":"Generator call","role":"Frozen video-model invocation for one leaf","visual_evidence":"The detailed right panel contains a Generator call box labeled frozen video model, one shot."},{"name":"Generated Segment","role":"Video output produced by a generator call","visual_evidence":"Segment thumbnails appear in the execution panel and a single output video segment appears in the detail panel."},{"name":"Parallel Execution","role":"Concurrent execution of independent leaves","visual_evidence":"Green adaptive segment bars are staggered on parallel rows in the phase 3(a) timeline."},{"name":"Sequential Execution","role":"Chained execution of boundary-dependent leaves","visual_evidence":"Orange adaptive segment bars are arranged sequentially with boundary handoff markers in phase 3(b)."},{"name":"Extractor","role":"Observation and verification of each generated segment","visual_evidence":"The left pipeline shows an Extractor box labeled observe & verify below Generated Segment."},{"name":"Refresh State","role":"Update of persistent state after extraction","visual_evidence":"The left pipeline shows Refresh State with update memory, confidence, freshness."},{"name":"Feed Back to Plan / Allocate","role":"Return of refreshed state to planning and allocation","visual_evidence":"An upward pipeline arrow connects refreshed state to the Feed Back to Plan / Allocate box and re-plan path."},{"name":"Context window (read)","role":"Context supplied to a selected leaf execution","visual_evidence":"The detail panel lists prev seg, plan / goal, and state mem under a context window bounded by token budget."},{"name":"Selected leaf","role":"Zoomed single execution unit","visual_evidence":"The right panel highlights a selected leaf described as one execute unit equal to one segment."},{"name":"Output: one video segment","role":"Detailed leaf result with adaptive duration and state conditions","visual_evidence":"The detail panel shows one output segment with duration and state-condition annotations."}],"relationships":[{"source_component":"Root Goal (Long Video)","relation":"is decomposed by","target_component":"Recursive Planning"},{"source_component":"Recursive Planning","relation":"contains","target_component":"Internal node (Plan / Allocate)"},{"source_component":"Internal node (Plan / Allocate)","relation":"branches into","target_component":"Leaf node (Execute)"},{"source_component":"Leaf node (Execute)","relation":"produces","target_component":"Generated Video Timeline"},{"source_component":"Leaf Execution","relation":"invokes","target_component":"Generator call"},{"source_component":"Generator call","relation":"produces","target_component":"Generated Segment"},{"source_component":"Leaf node (Execute)","relation":"can use","target_component":"Parallel Execution"},{"source_component":"Leaf node (Execute)","relation":"can use","target_component":"Sequential Execution"},{"source_component":"Generated Segment","relation":"is read by","target_component":"Extractor"},{"source_component":"Extractor","relation":"updates","target_component":"Refresh State"},{"source_component":"Refresh State","relation":"feeds back to","target_component":"Feed Back to Plan / Allocate"},{"source_component":"Selected leaf","relation":"reads","target_component":"Context window (read)"},{"source_component":"Context window (read)","relation":"conditions","target_component":"Generator call"},{"source_component":"Generator call","relation":"outputs","target_component":"Output: one video segment"},{"source_component":"Output: one video segment","relation":"writes back to","target_component":"Refresh State"}],"findings":["The figure presents ReCA as a recursive planning-to-generation pipeline rather than a single generation call.","Only terminal leaf execution units are connected to generator calls.","Independent leaves are visually distinguished from boundary-dependent leaves using green parallel and orange sequential timelines.","The generated-segment output is extracted, used to refresh persistent state, and fed back into planning and allocation.","The detailed leaf view emphasizes a token-budget-bounded context assembled from the previous segment, plan or goal, and state memory."],"citations":[{"section_id":"sec-1~59","path_id":"1~59","quote":"Recursive planning decomposes the long-video task (root) into context-bounded subproblems; only leaf nodes (blue) call the frozen generator."},{"section_id":"sec-1~59","path_id":"1~59","quote":"Independent leaves can run concurrently as parallel segments (green); leaves that share a boundary frame are chained sequentially with handoff arrows (orange)."},{"section_id":"sec-1~59","path_id":"1~59","quote":"Each generated segment is read by an extractor for observation and verification, refreshes the persistent state (memory, confidence, freshness), and feeds back into planning and allocation"},{"section_id":"sec-3","path_id":"3","quote":"ReCA recursively decomposes MSVE until every leaf call lies within both the duration budget τ G and the conditioning budget B G"},{"section_id":"sec-4.1","path_id":"4.1","quote":"The first operator addresses the global planning bottleneck (Fig. 3, phase 1)."},{"section_id":"sec-4.2","path_id":"4.2","quote":"The second operator addresses the shot-level dilution bottleneck (Fig. 3, phase 2)."}],"confidence":0.98,"provenance":{"image_sha256":"3a3bf3e4ec38c0019b31c535d09071e7c1ce64806d6a03227d41ffafb4e476c0","context_sha256":"5174410de4a6d7f301c06d0d388782eb0894b6a365963ce25188d17b7e86403f","route_id":"figure-qa-luna","protocol":"openai_chat_completions","requested_model":"cx/gpt-5.6-luna","resolved_model":"cx/gpt-5.6-luna","prompt_sha256":"4786e6f3681b05b0e475e188f0fbd61e98def58906b98ae8010b07dfd44df596","output_schema_sha256":"c3118303f0bd96421587a5951409e62f2b78da24809cc8f6028758b177fe3571","schema_id":"other_description","stage1_visual_type":"other","prompt_task_sha256":"1dd7985b1567eda8d66c3da3478eab188eb6764f7e1445eb1b1014b72ad08dd6","route_policy_sha256":"897498afc82f7598dc9ebd6687dba16a821e18722262df3e299e45136eed1940","model_binding_sha256":"01208a249b295331443fdc61a0e35c1fe80cfdaea164f7a8d95c94b82517f43c","input_sha256":"2dd9999ef36be6afec0250ca5f62361ae24996e581a897bb95e0a2eb14299a99","output_sha256":"2b77a74cfbec9b4b58f91626d26fe7d9f284d35bee96702e1a44a656dfd0b39f","input_tokens":3969,"output_tokens":1344,"latency_ms":26383},"typed_payload":null,"authoritative":false,"import_eligible":false}